WEBVTT

00:09:57.857 --> 00:10:03.668
and the strangest thing was that
because I was such an unlikely lawyer,

00:10:03.692 --> 00:10:07.209
I was the last person you ever would
have expected to go to law school --

00:10:07.233 --> 00:10:09.355
not only because of
these personality styles,

00:10:09.379 --> 00:10:11.526
but also I was
much more of a literary kid --

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:13.009
I ended up loving it.

00:10:13.033 --> 00:10:15.925
I found it just incredibly fascinating,

00:10:15.949 --> 00:10:17.830
because I experienced the whole thing

00:10:17.854 --> 00:10:21.580
as if it was just this lark
or an adventure,

00:10:21.604 --> 00:10:25.407
and I was in this foreign country
and I just had to figure it all out.

00:10:25.431 --> 00:10:28.192
And so, I actually felt that way
all through law school

00:10:28.216 --> 00:10:30.541
and for the first few years
of practicing law.